 # egui_dock changelog
 
+## 0.14.0 - Unreleased
+
+## Changed
+
+- `{DockState,Surface,Tree,Node}::{filter_map_tabs,map_tabs,filter_tabs,retain_tabs}` no longer require the predicate to
+  implement `Clone`. ([#241](https://github.com/Adanos020/egui_dock/pull/241))
+
 ## 0.13.0 - 2024-07-03
 
 ### Breaking changes
